# Notes
###############################################

# Tips:
# 1. Click ▶ to run a request
# 2. View response in bottom panel
# 3. Token is automatically saved after login
# 4. Use {{variable}} syntax for dynamic values
# 5. Uncomment (remove #) to enable coming soon endpoints
